   <text>
      <front/>
      <body>
         <div>
            <pb ed="TBOO" n="VII.91"/>
            <pb ed="A" n="106r"/>
            <opener>CLARISSIMO NOBILISSIMOQUE VIRO D. TYCHONI BRAHE, MATHEMATICO EXIMIO, DOMINO ET
               AMICO PLURIMUM COLENDO.<lb/>S. D.</opener>
            <p rend="noIndent">MITTO tibi Chartam et Typos, quos <placeName ref="Wittenberg"
                  >Witeberga</placeName> accepi. Papyri singulas Risas æstimat solidis 30. Hisce
               vasis inclusam ad me miserunt, si quid damni acceperit, non est, quod me culpes.
               Reliquos Typos <persName key="david_1585">DAVID</persName> auriga se allaturum, ubi
               fusi fuerint, promisit. Poscit in pondo 100 Ioachimum unum. In universum pro pecunia
               transmissa typorum fusori et typis huc transvehendis exigit 4 Thaleros. Quid insuper
               fieri velis significabis</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>[<persName key="brucaeus_heinrich_1530">H<hi rend="smallcaps">enricus</hi>
                        B<hi rend="smallcaps">rucæus</hi></persName>.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
